"Leo is Post Drop #1301, a talking mailbox in the F City arrival station on Anesidora."
"It likes to think of itself as Leo, though its creator forbids it to think of itself."
"Indah Juliana built it as her graduation capstone and gifted it to F City."
"It is larger than a refrigerator, with no buttons or screens and a single cabinet."
"It has a high, exuberant, metallic cartoon voice."
"It refuses explosives, delicate electronics and live animals."
"It charges half an Argold for standard post, by System link or a NesiCard dropped in with mail."
"It makes a boiling-kettle sound while scanning and offers receipts with Okey-dokey karaoke."
"It scans letters for keywords set by recipients on its Nice List, such as Corin Velra."
"It sends high-priority letters to the System through official channels."
"It plays recorded toilet flushes to get in the zone and aims for a zero spam week."
"It flagged Alden Thorn's letter to the Velras as so urgent someone came to collect it in person."
